{"id":"g2171","title":"Hekla lava","description":"Bei Erkrankungen im Übergangsbereich zwischen Knochen/Zahn und Bindegewebe, z. B. bei Pulpitis, Zahnwurzelgranulomen, Kieferostitis oder Fersensporn.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Synonym:"}]},{"type":"inline","id":"11572","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hekla lava e tephra"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (= aus der Vulkanasche) (GUDJONS). "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Es handelt sich um ein stark fluorhaltiges Eisen-Aluminium-Silikat jungen vulkanischen Ursprungs. "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Diese Substanz hat therapeutisch eine Beziehung zum Übergangsbereich zwischen Knochen/Zahn und Bindegewebe."}]}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": DHU; GUDJONS; SPAGYRA, Österreich. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Pulpitis, Zahnwurzelgranulome, Kieferostitis "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1884","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Mit Schmerzverschlimmerung auf Druck oder thermische Reize. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Anfangs 1–2 Tbl. D6 4–6 x tgl., nach Besserung noch für 2 Wo. 2–4 Tbl. tgl. Alternativ C6 Glob. (z.B. GUDJONS), pro Dosis 5 Glob. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach 1–2 Tg. Rückgang des Druckschmerzes. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2–3 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Ggf. begleitend 4 x tgl. 10 Tr. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0061.html","id":"11573","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Arnica, Planta tota"}]},{"type":"text","text":" D3 WELEDA oder 4 x tgl. 7 Glob. "},{"type":"inline","id":"11574","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Aconitum e tubere"}]},{"type":"text","text":" D6 WALA (siehe "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0170.html","id":"11575","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Aconitum napellus"}]},{"type":"text","text":"). 1 x tgl. 1 Amp. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g1196.html","id":"11576","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Periodontium/Silicea comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Amp. WALA submukös oder per os. "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bei Pulpitis "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0201.html","id":"11577","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Pulpa dentis"}]},{"type":"text","text":" D30 Amp. WALA."}]}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Wirkung nach 3 Tg. oft auch dann, wenn keine Wirkung auf Antibiotika beobachtet wird. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": PV. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Fersensporn "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1888","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 4 x tgl. 1 Tbl. D6, alternativ 2–3 x tgl. 5 Glob. C6 (z.B. GUDJONS). "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach 2–4 Wo. Besserung zu beobachten. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2–3 Mo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": PV. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"R2171","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Literatur "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"literature-R2171","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Roemer F. Therapiekonzepte der Anthroposophischen Medizin. Stufenpläne mit Differenzialdiagnostik. 2. Aufl. Stuttgart, New York: Georg Thieme Verlag 2018; 142."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Sommer M. Fluor – der Salzbildner unter den Elementen. Der Merkurstab 2021; 74(4): 312–324. "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-21382-DE","children":[{"type":"text","text":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-21382-DE"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]}]}]}]}